{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4c96ec36-ab81-8474-ad6b-522f7479710a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:15:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Teresa Silva",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:11:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:11:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Teresa Silva. I am calling about a storm drain. It is on the corner by my building, and it is completely full. Water is right up to the top of the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:12:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a storm drain that's full to the top. Where is that, Ms. Silva?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:12:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at 454 Bridge Street, in the Point. The drain is at the corner, right at the end of our block. [pause] It is not draining at all. I have been watching it since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:12:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Saturday, so since the nor'easter. Four fifty-four Bridge Street, and the drain is on the corner, not in front of the building. Do I have that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:12:46-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the corner. Not in front. The storm was Friday and Saturday, that was two days ago, and the rain stopped. The water in the street should be gone by now. It is not. It just sits there, full, with leaves and sticks on top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:13:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is the water up in the roadway, or just in the grate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:13:10-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the roadway, a big puddle, maybe the width of the lane. Cars are slowing to a crawl to go through it. Some of them wait, then go very slowly, and the water goes onto the sidewalk. I would like the drain to be cleaned, please. This is the kind of thing that should be done before a storm, not after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:13:34-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll put in a request for a crew to clean that catch basin. Let me read it back. Storm drain at the corner near 454 Bridge Street, The Point, blocked and full since the storm, water in the travel lane, slowing traffic. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:13:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. [pause] Sorry, one moment. There is a beeping in the background. It is the dryer, it finished its cycle. It is faint, but it keeps going. I will deal with it after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:14:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, take your time. Do you want to go turn it off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:14:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it is fine. It only beeps every little while. Please continue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there any water getting into your building, or is it just the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:14:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the street for now. But if it rains again, it will come up higher. That drain does not take water. I think it has been like this before, and nobody comes until I call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Do you want a callback number on the request, in case dispatch needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:14:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:14:50-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-three. Got it. Crews are stretched after a storm like this one, so it may take a few days to get to it, but this goes in as a blocked drain with standing water, so it gets looked at in that order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:15:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Hm. All right. But please, if someone can come sooner, it would be good. The cars, they are splashing people on the sidewalk too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:15:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that on the request. Anything else I can do for you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:15:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:15:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Silva. Take care."
    }
  ],
